# This environment variable is used to set the base URL for the site in preview deployments on Vercel. It ensures that the correct URL is used when generating links and assets in the preview environment.
# But it will be overridden in production deployments, where you should set the NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL to your actual production URL (e.g., https://optimize.deals) to ensure that the correct URL is used in the live environment.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL="https://${VERCEL_URL}"